## MEP cards (Haustechnik)

37 cards in 8 shared vignettes. Each vignette builds the full equipment set
in white and accents only the card's element (all instances of it, e.g. both
diffusers). Devices use the IFC4 class from the element YAML (`entity_ifc4`);
the scene is picked from the slug in `generators/mep.py` → `generate_mep`.
Pipe / duct / cable-tray segments are dashed context unless they are the
accent (`render/isometric.py` fills accented `_OUTLINE_ONLY_CLASSES`).

